00:05:00.445 --> 00:05:01.879
&gt;&gt; Juan: I THINK WE ARE

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.847
SUPPOSED TO BE, YOU KNOW, GOOD

00:05:03.848 --> 00:05:06.083
