00:05:06.084 --> 00:05:07.284
WHAT IS WRONG WITH TRYING?

00:05:07.285 --> 00:05:08.686
&gt;&gt; Dana: I THINK IT'S A GREAT

00:05:08.687 --> 00:05:09.920
