00:05:09.921 --> 00:05:10.888
THE CURRENT PAPER STRAW DON'T

00:05:10.889 --> 00:05:12.690
LAST LONG ENOUGH AND IT'S

00:05:12.691 --> 00:05:13.290
ANNOYING.

00:05:13.291 --> 00:05:14.491
ALL YOU SMART WHIPPERSNAPPERS

00:05:14.492 --> 00:05:14.892
OUT THERE.

00:05:14.893 --> 00:05:17.094
&gt;&gt; Greg: I HAVE AN IDEA:

00:05:17.095 --> 00:05:17.861
PLASTIC STRESS.

00:05:17.862 --> 00:05:20.064
NOTHING WILL EVER BE BETTER.

00:05:20.065 --> 00:05:21.498
CHINA, INDONESIA, PHILIPPINES,

00:05:21.499 --> 00:05:23.867
THEY FEEL THE OCEAN WITH

00:05:23.868 --> 00:05:24.201
PLASTIC.

00:05:24.202 --> 00:05:25.402
&gt;&gt; Jesse: CAN I SAY ONE THING

00:05:25.403 --> 00:05:26.470
ABOUT STRAWS.

00:05:26.471 --> 00:05:28.238
THE ONLY PEOPLE THAT USE DRAWS

00:05:28.239 --> 00:05:30.040
OUR BABIES, OKAY, OR WHEN YOU GO

00:05:30.041 --> 00:05:31.442
THROUGH A DRIVE-THRU SO YOU

00:05:31.443 --> 00:05:33.877
DON'T SPELL OR IF YOU ARE AT A

00:05:33.878 --> 00:05:36.246
FREE DRINK OR SOMETHING.

00:05:36.247 --> 00:05:37.081
&gt;&gt; Dana: HOW ABOUT THE

00:05:37.082 --> 00:05:37.848
BALL GAME?

00:05:37.849 --> 00:05:40.050
&gt;&gt; Jesse: EVERYBODY CAN DRINK

00:05:40.051 --> 00:05:40.417
OUT OF --

00:05:40.418 --> 00:05:41.952
&gt;&gt; Greg: NO, NO, I'M SAVING

00:05:41.953 --> 00:05:43.287
YOU HEARTACHE.

00:05:43.288 --> 00:05:44.822
AGREE WITH ME.

00:05:44.823 --> 00:05:45.522
THE DISABLED RELIED PLASTIC

00:05:45.523 --> 00:05:45.856
STRAWS.

00:05:45.857 --> 00:05:47.124
&gt;&gt; Jesse: THEY DO AND THEY

00:05:47.125 --> 00:05:49.259
SHOULD BE ABLE TO HAVE ACCESS.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:50.594
&gt;&gt; Juan: THE D.C. BILL ALLOWS

00:05:50.595 --> 00:05:51.895
THEM TO HAVE PLASTIC STRAWS.

00:05:51.896 --> 00:05:53.764
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I READ THE BILL,

00:05:53.765 --> 00:05:54.064
GREG.

00:05:54.065 --> 00:05:55.165
&gt;&gt; Dana: THE BEST THING THAT

00:05:55.166 --> 00:05:56.266
EVER HAPPEN AT AT OUR HOUSE.

00:05:56.267 --> 00:05:59.803
MY MOM WOULD LET US BUY BENDY

00:05:59.804 --> 00:06:00.137
STRAWS.

00:06:00.138 --> 00:06:03.040
&gt;&gt; Greg: SILLY STRAWS.

00:06:03.041 --> 00:06:04.441
DON'T BAN THEM.

